{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415044","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415044","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041504401:1":{"text":"...너, 맛없는 냄새가 나는군.","source_cn":"……你闻起来不好吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9676BBD78F9A4D89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504402:1":{"text":"식탐에 사로잡힌 멍청이군. 죽음의 함대에서 가장 쓸모없는 놈도 너보다는 낫겠어.","source_cn":"被食欲冲昏了头的傻瓜，死潮舰队最没用的男儿都比你强。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE859BFF6916CF07F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504403:1":{"text":"길 막지 말고 비켜!","source_cn":"别挡路，让开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D3D39DFDA5B8AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504404:1":{"text":"길을 막은 건 너다!","source_cn":"挡路的是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CB12E1A414A905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504405:1":{"text":"크릉!","source_cn":"吼——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA1170FCECA0E340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504406:1":{"text":"허, 몸만 컸지 머리는 텅 비었군.","source_cn":"嗬，四肢倒是发达，就是没脑子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0A7277D58F69ABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504407:1":{"text":"넌 뇌가 있어서 여기 갇혔나?","source_cn":"你有脑子，不一样被困在这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E94378C73E193E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504408:1":{"text":"넌 나보다 얼마나 강하지?","source_cn":"你又比我强多少呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35745D379E1C14A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504409:1":{"text":"맛도 없고 쓸모도 없는 늙다리 주제에, 여기선 날 건드릴 배짱조차 없잖아?","source_cn":"你甚至都不敢在这里对我动手，不好吃又没用的老家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A69AD9D63D9F26E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504410:1":{"text":"반티스 성물만 내 손에 있었다면 넌 갈가리 찢기고도 남았다.","source_cn":"要是班题斯圣器在我手里，你早就被我碾碎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4ECE66ECB4375C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504411:1":{"text":"죽음의 함대의 선장은 바다 생물을 어떻게 잡아야 하는지 아주 잘 알지!","source_cn":"死潮舰队的舰长，最擅长对付海里的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E7EEE3F22D93C93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504412:1":{"text":"찢겨? 찢긴 건 맛이 없어. 고기는 큼직한 덩어리로 씹어먹어야지. 그래야 제일 맛있거든!","source_cn":"碾碎？碾碎的东西不好吃，咬下大块的肉，才好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41425404A10071A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504413:1":{"text":"건장한 것치곤 머리는 이미 텅 빈 모양인데, 하하하하!","source_cn":"看你长得强壮，实际上脑子早就被吃掉了吧！哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF2CDE34BA7D21B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504414:1":{"text":"쯧, 멍청한 미치광이군.","source_cn":"啧，没脑子的神经病。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x255CAF70CB5C3697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041504415:1":{"text":"어리석은 것. 이미 식욕에 완전히 지배당한 꼭두각시구만.","source_cn":"多可悲的蝼蚁，已经完全沦为食欲的傀儡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x915FA1A5786B9540","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041504416:1":{"text":"하지만 멍청한 것도 나쁘진 않겠지. 쓸모가 있을지도 모르니...","source_cn":"但是，蠢一点也没什么坏处。或许可以为我所用……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6DF536F4ADCD79B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":